ith sausage. The cook on the egg was just as I like just a little moisture and perfect texture. My wife had burrata eggs and she said it was delicious. I also had a cortado coffee which was a nice spin on a macchiato with more creme. I recommend this cafe hole heartedly."},{"business_id":"tPuso2lzqdPM3sje6gWzsA","review_id":"n3arP1QcunFU358DXOrqYw","date":"2018-10-17T18:42:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9222473502159119,"text_excerpt":"For being so darn simple (eggs, cheddar cheese, potatoes, and fresh salsa), the breakfast burrito HITS the spot. I regularly order from Uber EATs, however I did stop in once and loved the ambiance of the cafe. I will certainly try the eggs burrata one day, but it will be difficult to rip myself away from that breakfast burrito goodness. As for lunch, the sandwiches are simple but fresh, although a *tad* overpriced."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"tPuso2lzqdPM3sje6gWzsA","photo_id":"_5qR2ve0MB-EECC36EGAPw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/_5qR2ve0MB-EECC36EGAPw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9227007031440735},{"business_id":"tPuso2lzqdPM3sje6gWzsA","photo_id":"Rgle0Sra1WRdrWZY9aKizw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Rgle0Sra1WRdrWZY9aKizw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8662970066070557},{"business_id":"tPuso2lzqdPM3sje6gWzsA","photo_id":"aboH87m1fItYXVgIT-RXLw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aboH87m1fItYXVgIT-RXLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8652914762496948}]},"notebook_case":null}
